e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T08:59:37.4217092Z ok - a proxy is neither crowned over nor used to promote an unfit-only partition (left to the refill)
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T08:59:37.4217660Z ok - without exclusions the zombie guard still promotes the Active slave
e2e-test (authority)	Run pure safety tests	2026-10-06T08:59:37.4218173Z ok - a slave that activates under an Active master drops its lastMasterOf marker
